@startuml heavy_flow
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam activityFontName Microsoft YaHei

title 破防重击（HEAVY）结算流程 — Intention #36

|CardResolver|
start
:收集所有 Resolver，按 priority 排序;

|HeavyDamageResolver (P10)|
:检查对方是否有 GUARD;
if (对方有 GUARD?) then (是)
    :记录 "blocked by GUARD";
else (否)
    :对方受到 1 点伤害;
endif

|RemoveDefenseResolver (P10)|
:检查对方是否有 DEFENSE;
if (对方有 DEFENSE?) then (是)
    :移除对方 DEFENSE;
    :记录 "removes opponent DEFENSE";
else (否)
    :无操作;
endif

|GrantFragileResolver (P10)|
:检查对方是否有 GUARD;
if (对方有 GUARD?) then (是)
    :记录 "Fragile blocked by GUARD";
else (否)
    :调用 opponent.extend_status(FRAGILE, extra=2);
    :记录 "extends FRAGILE by 2 rounds";
endif

stop

@enduml
